          "items": [
            "**Input Validation & Normalization:** `[IN PROGRESS]` (Basic URL normalization in `task_initial_triage`).",
            "**Content Type Detection Module:** `[COMPLETED]` (Implemented with `ContentTypeDetectionTool` in `utility_tools.py`, used by `task_initial_triage`).",
            "**Routing Logic (to acquisition agents TS-AI-R-1, 2, 3):** `[PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED]` (Current `run_crew_directly.py` hardcodes the URL path; dynamic agent/task selection by orchestrator based on content type is not yet implemented).",
