            "**State Management (CrewAI context):** `[COMPLETED]` (Implicitly used by CrewAI for task output passing).",
            "**Error Aggregation & Reporting:** `[NEEDS REVIEW/REFINEMENT]` (Basic try-except in `run_crew_directly.py`; more robust error handling and status propagation needed, especially from `WebContentFetcherTool` through to final output).",
